    <!-- Main Breaking News Section -->
    <!-- Comment: Breaking News Module -->
    <div id="latest-news">
        <section>
            <!-- Section Subheading (h2) -->
            <h2>Breaking News: Global Tech Summit 2026</h2>
            
            <!-- Paragraphs (p) -->
            <p>Tech leaders from around the globe gathered today to discuss the future of artificial intelligence, sustainable energy, and digital privacy. The summit highlights major developments expected to reshape technology over the next decade.</p>
            
            <p>Industry experts emphasized the need for transparent regulations and ethical AI development to protect consumers worldwide.</p>

            <!-- Clickable Image Link & Descriptive Image with alt tag -->
            <p><strong>Featured Article Cover (Click image to read full coverage on BBC):</strong></p>
            <a href="https://www.bbc.com/news" target="_blank">
